1467:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c **** /**
1468:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @brief  Configures the Synchronization Shift Control Settings.
1469:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @note   When REFCKON is set, firmware must not write to Shift control register.
1470:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @param  hrtc pointer to a RTC_HandleTypeDef structure that contains
1471:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   *                the configuration information for RTC.
1472:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_rtc_ex.c ****   * @param  ShiftAdd1S Select to add or not 1 second to the time calendar.
